  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Membership of the OECD Development Centre 2021 2022 extended</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the grant is to cover Denmark&apos;s membership of the OECD Development Centre from 1 January 2021 until 31 December 2022, which allows Denmark to benefit from the Centre&apos;s analyses and networking opportunities. The membership will ensure Denmark more direct access to dialogue with and between the various members, including members such as emerging economies that are not members of the OECD.
The Centre has played a key role in the development and implementation of the OECD Development Strategy. Overall, the Development Centre is working to meet the Sustainable Development Goals.</narrative>
  </description>
